#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is the title block?"
msgstr "什么是图框？"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:8
msgid ""
"The title block of a drawing is a table which usually is placed at the "
"bottom from the drawing. The title block is the responsible to provide all "
"necessary information to identify and verify the drawing validity."
msgstr "图纸的图框是一个表格，通常放置在图纸的底部。图框用于提供识别和验证图纸有效性所需的所有必要信息。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:15
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block example"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框示例"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:17
msgid "Some information which can be found at a title block is:"
msgstr "图框中常见的信息包括："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:19
msgid "Drawing / Schema title"
msgstr "图纸 / 原理图标题"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:20
msgid "Drawing / Schema number"
msgstr "图纸 / 原理图编号"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:21
msgid ""
"Drawing / Schema size (Horizontal A3 sheet is the more common at electrical "
"schemas)"
msgstr "图纸 / 原理图尺寸（横向 A3 图纸在电气原理图中最为常见）"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:22
msgid "Revision index"
msgstr "修订索引"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:23
msgid "Author"
msgstr "作者"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:24
msgid "Date"
msgstr "日期"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:25
msgid ""
"License (Ex.: `ISO 16016`_ protection notices for restricting the use of "
"documents and products)"
msgstr "许可证（例如：用于限制文档和产品使用的 `ISO 16016 <ISO 16016_>`_ 保护声明）"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:26
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "徽标"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:30
msgid ""
"Refer to `IEC 61082-1`_ norm for more detailed information about the "
"recommended content that should be included in the title block."
msgstr "有关图框中应包含的推荐内容的详细信息，请参阅 `IEC 61082-1 <IEC 61082-1_>`_ 标准。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:33
msgid "As table, the elements from a title block are:"
msgstr "作为表格，图框的元素包括："

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:35
msgid "`Cell`_"
msgstr "`单元格 <Cell_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:36
msgid "`Column`_"
msgstr "`列 <Column_>`_"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/what_is.rst:37
msgid "`Row`_"
msgstr "`行 <Row_>`_"
